  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、そうじゃなくてだな……\r\n咲耶はもっと──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "『もっと自分を大切にしろ』、かい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……その通りだ\r\nだから、そんなに急ぎ足にならなくていいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、すまないね\r\nアナタの気持ちはわかっているよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けれど、私を待っている人がいる……\r\nそう思ったら、のんびりもしていられないだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、咲耶はみんなを待たせたくないだろうが……\r\n転んで心配も、させたくないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020360,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！\r\nフフ。これはプロデューサーに一本取られたようだね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020370,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでは、慎重に歩くのはもちろんとして……\r\nそうだね、もしも私が転んだら受け止めてくれるかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020370"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ\r\n咲耶に怪我をさせるわけにはいかないからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020380,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それは心強いね\r\n……信じているよ、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020380"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "se": "0367",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢③【手を貸そうか？】",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "手を貸そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020390,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それには及ばないよ\r\nひとりでも問題なく……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020390"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020400,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……いや──\r\nここは素直に、お言葉に甘えさせてもらおうかな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020400"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020410,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……\r\nアナタの手、貸してもらえるかい？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020410"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ。もちろん構わないけど……\r\n気が変わったのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020420,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス、さすが私のプロデューサー。察しがいいね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020420"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020430,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "こんなふうに、アナタにエスコートされる\r\n機会などなかなかないからね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020430"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020440,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "せっかくのチャンスを逃したくなかっただけさ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020440"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "エスコートってほどでもないけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020450,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ……私にとってはこれで充分なんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600802/2006008020450"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006008020460,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "さぁ、私を撮影場所まで連れて行ってくれるかい？\r\nプロデューサー",
